$realworld_app_footer $realworld_app_el
	dom_name \footer
	sub /
		<= Container $realworld_app_el
			class_names \container
			sub /
				<= Brand $realworld_app_link
					class_base \logo-font
					arg *
					sub /
						\conduit
				<= Note $realworld_app_el
					dom_name \span
					class_names \attribution
					sub /
						\An interactive learning project. Code & design licensed under MIT.
